Subject: [GenABEL-dev] Proposal to move to Github
In-Reply-To: <CAHX9t6KEpymW3Pd0HtqRhZ4TrXXauTQ2GKKsZYs0rq=1U-20uA@mail.gmail.com>
References: <20140428094937.65E8B186FC6@r-forge.r-project.org>
